    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even recognize myself in the mirror anymore. everything i was... the strength, the way i moved... it’s just gone. my body feels like this heavy, broken thing that i’m just forced to carry around. it's like the person i actually was died when the injury happened, and now i'm just a shell.",
